Failures around uploads keep what is known: a failed attachment association keeps the upload receipt and leaves the effect unknown; a failed second upload grant stops before writing the comment.
-- seed.json --
{"Issue": [{"id": "1a000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000017", "identifier": "ENG-17", "title": "Evidence"}]}
-- file one.txt --
one
-- file two.txt --
two
-- faults.json --
[{"on": "mutation:attachmentCreate", "action": "status", "status": 200, "body": {"data": {"attachmentCreate": {"success": false, "attachment": null}}}}]
-- run --
linear issue attach ENG-17 one.txt --json
